The berserker taps into <PRO_HISHER> frenzy through sheer force of will. For the next two rounds, <PRO_HESHE> gains +15 maximum hit points and becomes immune to charm, confusion, feeblemindedness, hold, paralysis, sleep, and stun effects. If the remaining duration of Enrage is less than one round, melee attacks made by the berserker reset Enrage's duration to one round up to a maximum total duration of ten rounds. The berserker cannot cast spells while Enraged.~

